<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Albertson's said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Albertson's said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney lowered its recommendation on Albertson's Inc to neutral from buy, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 3/8 to 35-3/4 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
